     "keyword": "Order per shard",
     "name": "Partition Key",
     "tag": "Amazon Kinesis Data Streams",
     "text": "MD5-hashed to pick a shard; order is guaranteed only within a shard. Low-cardinality keys cause hot shards and write throttling."
    },
    {
     "keyword": "Batch & aggregate",
     "name": "Producers",
     "tag": "Amazon Kinesis Data Streams",
     "text": "SDK PutRecords batches up to 500 records/call. KPL batches, aggregates small records, and retries automatically with slight latency."
    }
